    "name": "Secret Meadow",
    "steam_appid": 1993460,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993460/extras/b73cf099a2a7da7929be3aa89963f0ec.avif?t=1748226022\" data-has-big /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993460/extras/81f1bbd67cbdc485cd77f87aa04bad9c.avif?t=1748226022\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>currently in development</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill the forest by growing magical gardens and decorating them with the special items you craft and customize.  Gardening and decorating is not restricted to a specific area, so you can design unique gardens and cozy areas throughout the entire forest! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Secret Meadow, gardening is a low-maintenance magical experience. You can focus on your designs without getting caught up in the tedious life of a farmer.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you spread your magic, you will unlock new customization options for your Fairy.  <br>Transform and color your hair, eyes, skin, clothes, jewelry, and other accessories to express your fantasy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Forest Spirits and other magical creatures claim their home in the forest with you. Make friends, build houses, forage, fish, cook, and craft to uncover the secrets of Wind Chime Forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and create everything you need from the nature around you!  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993460/extras/b73cf099a2a7da7929be3aa89963f0ec.avif?t=1748226022\" data-has-big /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993460/extras/81f1bbd67cbdc485cd77f87aa04bad9c.avif?t=1748226022\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>currently in development</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill the forest by growing magical gardens and decorating them with the special items you craft and customize.  Gardening and decorating is not restricted to a specific area, so you can design unique gardens and cozy areas throughout the entire forest! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Secret Meadow, gardening is a low-maintenance magical experience. You can focus on your designs without getting caught up in the tedious life of a farmer.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you spread your magic, you will unlock new customization options for your Fairy.  <br>Transform and color your hair, eyes, skin, clothes, jewelry, and other accessories to express your fantasy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Forest Spirits and other magical creatures claim their home in the forest with you. Make friends, build houses, forage, fish, cook, and craft to uncover the secrets of Wind Chime Forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and create everything you need from the nature around you!  </p>",
    "short_description": "Secret Meadow is a cozy atmospheric sandbox RPG. Explore and transform a hand-drawn open world and live the peaceful magical life of a fairy. Without time pressures, combat, hunger, or exhaustion, you can focus on the atmospheric sandbox experience while designing the magical forest of your dreams.",
